      "role": "user",
      "content": "right, but i'm saying it feels more like a two-way street than just me reacting to the screen. if i'm really in the zone and my heart rate hits a certain tempo, the candlesticks actually seem to follow that pulse. it's almost like my internal clock is overriding the standard market timing. if i wanted to actually test this and maybe use it to time my entries better, how would i even start tracking the correlation between my vitals and the order book flow? like, is there a way to quantify this connection?",
